#: scripts/quest_manager.gd:35
msgid ""
"Dear,\n"
"\n"
"You will have heard by now. I am at my sister's in Pelhrimov, and I am staying: my hip will not do the lake any more, and I am too old to pretend. The camp is yours. It was always going to be yours.\n"
"\n"
"It has been shut since last summer. After your uncle went I did not have the strength to open it again, and a winter with nobody in it has done the rest: the cabins have gone to rot and the tents are rags.\n"
"\n"
"Now the bad part. A firm, Agrostroj Hlubocany, wants the land: a feed mill where the cabins are and the lake for its water. The district is on their side. Their man comes to look on the nineteenth of October. If the camp is not open and paying by then, the district sells the land to them, and that is the end of it. A month. I know.\n"
"\n"
"Start with the old cabin by the office. Patch it up, clean it out, make up the bed: that is how every room here works. Then the programs. The builder: www.stavitel98.cz/BLDR98SW.EXE - and the guest register the district wants: www.okres-hlubocany.cz/GUESTRAK.EXE - click them, they download, then run them from the Download folder. CampStat is on the machine already, your uncle put it there; the bills are in it.\n"
"\n"
"I left you $850. Do not spend it on the slide.\n"
"\n"
"I will write when I can. The phone will ring at night sometimes. You do not have to answer it.\n"
"\n"
"- Teta Vera"
msgstr ""

