#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:36
msgid "Mrs Hruba"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:38
msgid "You are from the camp. I can tell by the boots. That black mud is the lake."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:39
msgid "My Karel kept the boats up there thirty years. One night he rowed out to fetch something. The boat came back by itself."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:40
msgid "There is a photograph of his on your board, I expect. The lake from the jetty. Look at the middle of it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:41
msgid "Vera used to bring me eggs from the camp. Then she stopped coming down. Then she stopped."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:42
msgid "Do not buy the sausages on a Monday."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:44
msgid "You should not be out. Go to the motel, Simek keeps a light on."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:47
msgid "The bus? Three a day. The last one up to you goes at half past six. Nobody goes up there after dark anyway."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:48
msgid "The works bus at midnight goes up to the dam. Nobody gets on, nobody gets off. My cousin drives it. He says it is heavier coming back."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:49
msgid "Lesnak's at the Jednota. Ten degrees. Tastes like the reservoir."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:50
msgid "They say your register never adds up. More people in the beds than in the book."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:51
msgid "Lojza at the Benzina down by your turn pays cash if you can hold a nozzle steady. Do not ask him about the Tatra."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:53
msgid "Pub's open. Kubat won't let you in the cellar, don't ask."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:53
msgid "Listen. No dogs tonight. When the dogs stop, I go home."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:59
msgid "A beer is a dollar. The second one is a dollar too. The tenth one, we talk."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:61
msgid "Last orders at eleven. After that I lock the door and I do not open it, whoever knocks. Whoever."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:62 scripts/town/town_room.gd:233 scripts/town/town_room.gd:530 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:436 (+4)
#. uses 8
msgid "Mr Simek"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:64
msgid "A room is fifteen. Breakfast is a promise, not a guarantee."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:65
msgid "Your camp people stay here when they miss the bus. Some of them. Some just stand in the car park all night looking up the road."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:66
msgid "Do not open the window in number six. It does not open, but do not."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:68
msgid "Fifteen dollars. Key's on the board. Lock it twice."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:69
msgid "Sgt Vavra"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:71
msgid "The camp? You are the new one up there. The district has been asking about your register."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:72
msgid "Persons found in a facility who are not in the register are not the district's responsibility. It is on the notice. Read it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:73
msgid "In ninety-four a man walked in out of the forest with a camp key in his hand. He could not say his name. Still can't."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:74
msgid "Off the road at night. The works bus does not brake."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:76
msgid "Home. Now."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:79
msgid "Have you seen the man in the corn? My brother has. He won't say what he looks like."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:80
msgid "Bet you a crown you won't swim in your lake at night."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:81
msgid "My bike's faster than the bus. The bus doesn't stop for anybody after dark."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:45
msgid "Rychla kacka. Scratch it at home, not on my counter."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:63
msgid "Saint Prokop, in brown, a book under his arm. The paint has gone from his hands where they have been touched."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:64
msgid "Somebody has tucked a folded note behind his foot. You leave it there."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:67
msgid "The painting is too dark to make out. A figure in a boat, maybe. Water, certainly."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:68
msgid "Paper flowers, the colour gone out of them. A fresh one among them, red."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:71
msgid "A hymn book left open. Somebody has underlined a line in pencil and rubbed it out again."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:72
msgid "Scratched into the pew in front, small: V. + K. 1971."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:75
msgid "Pump first, then pay. Or pay, then pump. Just pay."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:76
msgid "Lojza says you are good at the pumps. Lojza says a lot."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:77
msgid "Maps of the district, forty crowns, eight years old. The roads have not moved."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:80
msgid "Rooms from seven in the evening. Fifteen dollars."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:81
msgid "The camp people used to come down for the shower. Then they stopped coming down at all."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:82
msgid "Number four has the best mattress. Number six I do not let."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Camp up the lake, is it. My brother worked the boats there. Before."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Do not swim at night. Nobody tells you that, so I am telling you."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Kubat, another."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "The bus driver does not stop at the cross after dark. Ask him why. He will not say."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "You buying? No? Then why are you at my bar."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "I drove for the JZD. Twenty years. The silo has a cellar nobody filled in."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "Na zdravi, camp."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:228
msgid "Cold, and the smell of wax."
msgstr ""

